; Custom Root Hints file for 7-VM DNS Tree
; Points the recursive resolver to Root Primary (.30) and Root Secondary (.90)
.                       3600000      NS    ns1.root.
.                       3600000      NS    ns2.root.
ns1.root.               3600000      A     192.168.56.30
ns2.root.               3600000      A     192.168.56.90
